.gstack/
.claude/
# MCP server config — local only. It is OAuth-based, so the cloud session
# cannot authenticate against it; committing it would advertise access
# that does not exist there.
.mcp.json

# Probe output: raw HTML captured from a live portal. Never committed.
# The BALAM listing carries a contact-phone column, and a saved page holds
# real numbers -- 14 in the first capture. REPOMIX.md ADR/risk table records
# that `contact_phone` was dropped for exactly that reason, and that removing
# the field alone was theatre because `raw_row` still carried it; the same
# logic applies here, one layer further out. Fixtures are for running tests
# locally, not for the repository.
scraper-service/tests/fixtures/

# repomix packed output
repomix-output.xml

